@page "/"

<PageTitle>Storefront</PageTitle>

<h1>Storefront</h1>

<p>
    A small front end for the three sample services. It talks to them over HTTP and reads every answer into a
    <code>Result</code>, so a failed call shows its problem details instead of throwing.
</p>

<ul>
    <li><a href="orders">Orders</a> – place an order and ship it. The Shipments service delivers it in about 20 seconds,
        and the order's fulfillment completes.</li>
    <li><a href="products">Products</a> – add a product to the Catalog and find it with search a few seconds later.</li>
</ul>
